translate japanese strings:

    # game/compendium.rpy:15
    old "Ask what else could explain it. Coming first is not the same as causing."
    new "他に説明はないか考えよう。先に起きたことが原因とは限らない。"

    # game/compendium.rpy:15
    old "Check whether the reply is about the claim, or about the person who made it."
    new "反論が主張そのものに向いているか、言った人に向いているかを確かめよう。"

    # game/compendium.rpy:15
    old "Look for a chain of \"and then\" steps with no evidence for each link."
    new "「そして次に」が続くのに、それぞれのつながりに証拠がないなら要注意。"

    # game/compendium.rpy:15
    old "Someone else doing it doesn't make it right. Judge the act, not the accuser."
    new "他の誰かがやっていても、正しくはならない。告発した人ではなく、行為を裁こう。"

    # game/compendium.rpy:15
    old "When you're offered two choices, ask where the third one went."
    new "選択肢が二つしか出されなかったら、三つ目はどこへ行ったのか考えよう。"

    # game/compendium.rpy:15
    old "A name is not a test. Ask what evidence the expert actually has."
    new "名前は試験ではない。その専門家が実際にどんな証拠を持っているか聞こう。"

    # game/compendium.rpy:15
    old "Take the claim out of the reason. If nothing is left, it's a circle."
    new "理由から主張を取り除いてみよう。何も残らなければ、それは循環だ。"

    # game/compendium.rpy:31
    old "I wore my lucky socks and passed the exam. The socks did it."
    new "勝負靴下をはいたら試験に受かった。靴下のおかげだ。"

    # game/compendium.rpy:31
    old "The rooster crowed, then the sun rose. Clearly the rooster raises the sun."
    new "鶏が鳴いて、それから日が昇った。明らかに鶏が太陽を昇らせている。"

    # game/compendium.rpy:31
    old "Since the shrine got a new bell, it rains more. Ring it less."
    new "神社に新しい鈴がついてから雨が増えた。鳴らす回数を減らそう。"

    # game/compendium.rpy:31
    old "Why take magic safety advice from Marisa? She steals books."
    new "魔法の安全について魔理沙の助言なんて聞くか？あいつは本を盗むんだぞ。"

    # game/compendium.rpy:31
    old "Your sums are wrong because you're a fairy."
    new "お前の計算は間違ってる。だってお前は妖精だから。"

    # game/compendium.rpy:31
    old "Reimu says the bridge is rotten, but she's lazy, so it's fine."
    new "霊夢は橋が腐ってると言うけど、あいつは怠け者だから大丈夫。"

    # game/compendium.rpy:31
    old "Let one youkai shop in the village, and soon they'll run the market."
    new "妖怪を一人でも里で買い物させたら、すぐに市場を牛耳られる。"

    # game/compendium.rpy:31
    old "Skip one practice and you'll quit for good, then lose everything."
    new "練習を一回休んだら、二度とやらなくなって、全部失う。"

    # game/compendium.rpy:31
    old "Lend her one book and she'll want the whole library by spring."
    new "一冊貸したら、春までに図書館ごと欲しがるぞ。"

    # game/compendium.rpy:31
    old "Why should I stop being late? You were late last week."
    new "どうして遅刻をやめなきゃいけないの？あなたも先週遅刻したじゃない。"

    # game/compendium.rpy:31
    old "You can't tell me to tidy up. Your room's a mess too."
    new "片付けろなんて言わせない。あなたの部屋だって散らかってる。"

    # game/compendium.rpy:31
    old "Don't lecture me about naps. Meiling sleeps on duty every day."
    new "昼寝のことで説教しないで。美鈴なんて毎日勤務中に寝てる。"

    # game/compendium.rpy:31
    old "Either you love summer, or you hate fun."
    new "夏が大好きか、楽しいことが大嫌いか、どっちかだ。"

    # game/compendium.rpy:31
    old "You agree with me, or you weren't listening."
    new "私に賛成か、話を聞いていなかったかのどちらかだ。"

    # game/compendium.rpy:31
    old "We cancel the festival, or everyone gets soaked. Those are the choices."
    new "祭りを中止するか、みんなずぶ濡れになるか。選択肢はそれだけだ。"

    # game/compendium.rpy:31
    old "A famous chef says the moon is cheese. Who are you to argue?"
    new "有名な料理人が月はチーズだと言っている。反論できる立場かね？"

    # game/compendium.rpy:31
    old "The village elder says frogs can't feel cold. That settles it."
    new "里の長老がカエルは寒さを感じないと言っている。これで決まりだ。"

    # game/compendium.rpy:31
    old "A tengu reporter wrote it, so it must be true."
    new "天狗の記者が書いたんだから、本当に違いない。"

    # game/compendium.rpy:31
    old "This book is true, because the book says it's true."
    new "この本は真実だ。なぜなら本にそう書いてあるから。"

    # game/compendium.rpy:31
    old "Cirno is the strongest because nobody is stronger than Cirno."
    new "チルノが最強なのは、チルノより強い者がいないからだ。"

    # game/compendium.rpy:31
    old "I'm trustworthy. You can trust me on that."
    new "私は信用できる。それは私が保証する。"

    # game/compendium.rpy:96
    old "Practice"
    new "練習"

    # game/compendium.rpy:101
    old "Practice starts from the title screen."
    new "練習はタイトル画面から始められます。"

    # game/compendium.rpy:103
    old "Five statements. Name the fallacy in each. Best: [persistent.practice_best] / 5."
    new "五つの発言。それぞれの誤謬を言い当てよう。最高記録：[persistent.practice_best] / 5"

    # game/compendium.rpy:105
    old "Catch two fallacies in court to unlock practice."
    new "法廷で誤謬を二つ見破ると練習が解放されます。"

    # game/compendium.rpy:126
    old "How to spot it: [card.tip!t]"
    new "見破り方：[card.tip!t]"

    # game/compendium.rpy:128
    old "Caught in [taught.number!t]: [taught.title!t]"
    new "[taught.number!t]で発見：[taught.title!t]"

    # game/compendium.rpy:140
    old "Close [met.number!t] to add this page."
    new "[met.number!t]を閉廷するとこのページが加わります。"

    # game/compendium.rpy:186
    old "PRACTICE [number] / [PRACTICE_LENGTH]"
    new "PRACTICE [number] / [PRACTICE_LENGTH]"

    # game/compendium.rpy:214
    old "Stop practice"
    new "練習をやめる"

    # game/compendium.rpy
    old "Met in [met.number!t]: [met.title!t]"
    new "[met.number!t]で登場：[met.title!t]"
